                    "message": "bad paste, will try again:\n```\nFAILED: phosphor-log-manager.p/log_manager_main.cpp.o                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   c++ @phosphor-log-manager.p/log_manager_main.cpp.o.rsp\nIn file included from ../extensions.hpp:3,\n                 from ../log_manager_main.cpp:5:\n../elog_entry.hpp:9:10: fatal error: sdeventplus/event.hpp: No such file or directory\n    9 | #include <sdeventplus/event.hpp>\n      |          ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                compilation terminated.  \n```"
